  <issue>
  Update release script to support pre-releases
**Description of Problem**:
If you want to tag a pre-release the release script does not accept, for example, the version number `1.10.0a1`. It just supports `1.10.0-alpha1`. Also the release script deletes all changelog files and update the `CHANGELOG.rst` file. This should not happen on a pre-release. We want to keep those updates for the next minor release.

**Overview of the Solution**:
Add support for pre-release versions, such as `1.10.0a1`.
Skip updating the `CHANGELOG.rst` file for pre-releases.
  </issue>
  
